# This is an EXUDYN maintainer tool
#
# Details:  Emits the hand-written Python interface from its declarations in definitions/pybind*.py:
#           src/Autogenerated/pybind_manual_classes.h, the stub fragments stubAutoBindings.pyi,
#           stubSymbolic.pyi and stubEnums.pyi, docs/generated/cInterface/*.md (Markdown since
#           revision2026 step R7.1.6, replacing docs/theDoc/manual_interfaces.tex and
#           docs/RST/cInterface/*.rst) and docs/RST/confHelper.py; it also has
#           outputVariableEmitter write OutputVariableTypes.h. Replaces the script body of
#           src/pythonGenerator/autoGeneratePyBindings.py (revision2026 step R4.3, part 2d); the
#           output is byte-identical.
#
#           Reads tools/generators/generated/MainSystemCreateExt and MainSystemExt (.md and .rst),
#           written by mainSystemExtensionDocsEmitter.py, which tools/regenerate.py runs before this
#           emitter (revision2026 step R4.3 part 2e; part 2f makes such inputs explicit).
#
# Usage:    python tools/generators/pybindEmitter.py
#
# Author:   Johannes Gerstmayr
# Date:     2018-05-18 (created as autoGeneratePyBindings.py), 2026-09-14 (emitter)
# Copyright:This file is part of Exudyn. Exudyn is free software: see 'LICENSE.txt'
#
